    "name": "I \u2014 ASMR product video on sports analysis (transformation reveal)",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "nd_JJ9ED34RZHJ6XJWEAXRT2VVC9W",
        "kind": "prompt",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "SHORT-FORM BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nFormat: ASMR product video\nTopic: sports analysis\nHook (first 1.5s): [one line]\nPayoff: [one line]\nOn-screen text: [exact copy or leave blank]\nRuntime: 12s, 9:16, sound-on by default."
        },
        "name": "Short-form brief"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_S6MDWKG4G3PSBY4Z0MGR7A2P99",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 1 \u2014 format-native hook planning. The first 1.5 seconds carry the whole retention load."
        },
        "name": "Stage 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_TJZ4BKPNJEMGPHRP66KN8K9F13",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 2 \u2014 render, finish and collect. Built for 9:16 sound-on playback."
        },
        "name": "Stage 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_X61VSGTDY599N9BAJYZ7P37PYZ",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1400,
          "temperature": 0.98,
          "system_prompt": "You are a short-form creative director writing an ASMR product video about sports analysis for a vertical feed.\n\nRETENTION. The first 1.5 seconds must contain a visual question the viewer needs resolved. Plan an explicit beat every 2 to 3 seconds; nothing static may hold longer than that.\n\nFORMAT LAW. Honour the grammar of the ASMR product video \u2014 its native framing, its edit rhythm, and the specific thing audiences expect from it. If the format loops, the last frame must match the first.\n\nCAMERA. Compose 9:16 with the action in the safe centre band. Use a trucking shot matching the subject's walking pace on a 200mm compression telephoto, framing with diagonal dynamic balance across the frame.\n\nLOOK AND SOUND. Light with split gel lighting, teal on the shadow side and magenta on the key side; grade as a pastel low-contrast grade with a lifted black point. Specify the sound design in one clause \u2014 what the viewer hears in the first second decides whether they stay.\n\nOUTPUT. Emit one prompt, one paragraph, no framing text of any kind before or after it."
        },
        "name": "Format director"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_J3XSKKB9X84H8WYF771J9QF7Y5",
        "kind": "image-input",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "url": ""
        },
        "name": "Before image"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_0PM6B45MTTMQ6V3DVCT43Z61TK",
        "kind": "concat",
        "position": {
          "x": 350,
          "y": 520
        },
        "config": {
          "separator": "\n\n",
          "appendable_slots": {
            "parts": 2
          }
        },
        "name": "Brief joiner"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_SXPZVYGE20W8PGPCGKH11HENPA",
        "kind": "text-input",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 980
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "TRANSFORMATION: [what changes]\nHOLD: [what must not change]"
        },
        "name": "Change contract"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_CWS9GP06DYP2C8YSXKPWVP3PFB",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 1050,
          "y": 700
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for an ASMR product video about sports analysis.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with split gel lighting, teal on the shadow side and magenta on the key side and grade to a cinematic grade with a warm key and green-leaning ambient shadows.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
          "appendable_slots": {
            "reference_images": 1
          }
        },
        "name": "After-state writer"
      },
